(Request Processor - Plain-Language Overview) Tj
0 -14 Td
0 -14 Td
(What this system does \(in simple words\)) Tj
0 -14 Td
(- You send a request to the server using an API.) Tj
0 -14 Td
(- The server saves your request in a database and immediately replies, so you are not kept) Tj
0 -14 Td
(waiting.) Tj
0 -14 Td
(- A background worker processes the request later.) Tj
0 -14 Td
(- You can check the status anytime or cancel it if it is still running.) Tj
0 -14 Td
0 -14 Td
(Why this design) Tj
0 -14 Td
(- It prevents the same request from being processed twice.) Tj
0 -14 Td
(- It handles failures safely and retries only when it makes sense.) Tj
0 -14 Td
(- It works correctly even if many requests arrive at the same time.) Tj
0 -14 Td
0 -14 Td
(Main building blocks) Tj
0 -14 Td
0 -14 Td
(1\) API Controller \(ProcessingRequestsController\)) Tj
0 -14 Td
(- This is the front door.) Tj
0 -14 Td
(- It checks your request, ensures you provided an Idempotency-Key, and sends back a) Tj
0 -14 Td
(response.) Tj
0 -14 Td
(- It returns friendly errors if something is wrong \(missing data, bad JSON, etc.\).) Tj
0 -14 Td
0 -14 Td
(2\) Database Model \(ProcessingRequest\)) Tj
0 -14 Td
(- This is the record stored in the database.) Tj
0 -14 Td
(- It keeps the request data, status, attempts, timestamps, and any errors.) Tj
0 -14 Td
(- Status values: pending, processing, retrying, completed, failed, cancelled.) Tj
0 -14 Td
0 -14 Td
(3\) Idempotency Service \(RequestSubmission\)) Tj
0 -14 Td
(- This makes sure the same Idempotency-Key is not used twice with different data.) Tj
0 -14 Td
(- If the same key is used with the same payload, it does not create duplicates.) Tj
0 -14 Td
0 -14 Td
(4\) Background Job \(ProcessRequestJob\)) Tj
0 -14 Td
(- This is the worker that processes requests in the background.) Tj
0 -14 Td
(- It locks the database row so two workers cannot process the same request.) Tj
0 -14 Td
(- It retries only for retryable errors and stops for non-retryable ones.) Tj
0 -14 Td
0 -14 Td
(5\) Processor \(RequestProcessing::Processor\)) Tj
0 -14 Td
(- This is the core business logic.) Tj
0 -14 Td
(- It simulates real work and can intentionally fail in different ways for testing.) Tj
0 -14 Td
0 -14 Td
(6\) Error Types \(RequestProcessingErrors\)) Tj
0 -14 Td
(- RetryableError: something temporary, should retry.) Tj
0 -14 Td
(- NonRetryableError: permanent failure, do not retry.) Tj
0 -14 Td
0 -14 Td
(7\) JSON Hashing \(CanonicalJson\)) Tj
0 -14 Td
(- Ensures the payload is hashed in a consistent way.) Tj
0 -14 Td
(- This is how we detect "same key, different payload".) Tj
0 -14 Td
0 -14 Td
ET
endstream
